 "about": "Test vectors for the home-control messages between a device and this integration (version 1). Every key here is a throw-away TEST key; only the public halves exist. A gate must accept control against device_pubkey; a device must accept taken, result and refused against gate_pubkey. refuse_signature is control changed after signing and must be refused. refuse_wrong_signer is a result signed with the device key instead of the gate key and must be refused by a device. The scheme is RSASSA-PSS, SHA-256, MGF1 with SHA-256, a 32-byte salt, over label followed by the wire bytes up to but not including the sig field, closed with a single closing brace.",
